# `round` rounds halves away from zero (LANGUAGE.md §7); integers stay `long`.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project a = round(2.5), b = round(-2.5), c = round(1.2345, 2), d = round(1250.0, -2), e = round(1249, -2), f = round(-1250, -2), g = round(7), h = round(0.5)
---- expected
a    | b    | c    | d      | e    | f     | g    | h
real | real | real | real   | long | long  | long | real
-----+------+------+--------+------+-------+------+-----
 3.0 | -3.0 | 1.23 | 1300.0 | 1200 | -1300 |    7 |  1.0
